# Full Bore (CR 702.185a): "If that creature was cast for its warp cost, it also gains trample and haste until end of turn."
# Bot1 casts Pinnacle Emissary for its warp cost {U/R} (a Mountain) on turn 1 and Full Bore on it (Mox Ruby): it is a 6/5
# with trample and haste, so it attacks the turn it came in and Bot2 takes 6. At the end step warp exiles it as usual.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Pinnacle Emissary
Full Bore
Mountain x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Pinnacle Emissary.Cast(Ability: Warp)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Full Bore.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Pinnacle Emissary)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
[T1 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pinnacle Emissary.Power = 6
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pinnacle Emissary.Toughness = 5
? Bot1.Battlefield.Pinnacle Emissary.Keywords = Haste; Trample
Bot1.Attack(Pinnacle Emissary > Bot2)
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 14
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
? Exile = Pinnacle Emissary

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 14
Bot1.Graveyard = Full Bore
